E.D.E.N. adapts source and artwork from the uploaded SPhone archive.
Original archive: SPhone-main (1).zip, preserved unchanged.
Reference repository: https://github.com/oriongplays/Sphone
Contributors credited by its README: Sandji, MK, Ertinox, Gabidut76, Afhistos, Yan36.
Original license: Apache License 2.0, retained alongside this notice.

Adapted elements: GuiBase/GuiHome portrait layout; app navigation and contacts,
messages and notes workflows; Message.java and Note.java data models; original
ui/icons, ui/background and items PNG artwork; phone and SIM item geometry.
Source and paths remain available in the uploaded reference archive.

Changes: modern NeoForge 1.21.1 GUI/widgets and item components; immutable bounded
records and native world persistence; FE batteries/network blocks; current optional
voice API; server validation; modern vanilla texture references in item models.
Legacy ACS, DynamX, JDBC and old voice binaries are not bundled. The reference ZIP
is not included in the runtime JAR. No MrCrayfish Device Mod code/assets are included.
